{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":47.529998779296875,"text":"Above everything else, at the highest point of the site, there is a flat strip of ground 177 meters long, with stone seats around it. It is the best-preserved ancient stadium in Greece, and held about 6,500 spectators. The Pythian Games were held here every four years, second in importance only to the Olympics. But they had something Olympia did not – music competitions. The first contest of the Pythian Games was not a race, but singing to the lyre. At the start line, the stone slabs survive, with grooves cut for the runners' toes, so that everybody began from the same line. You can put your own feet in them, and understand something words do not carry – the height, the air, and the quiet are exactly what they were.","words":[{"word":"Above","start":0,"end":0.7799999713897705},{"word":"everything","start":0.7799999713897705,"end":1.4199999570846558},{"word":"else","start":1.4199999570846558,"end":1.840000033378601},{"word":"at","start":1.9600000381469727,"end":2.0999999046325684},{"word":"the","start":2.0999999046325684,"end":2.319999933242798},{"word":"highest","start":2.319999933242798,"end":2.740000009536743},{"word":"point","start":2.740000009536743,"end":3.0399999618530273},{"word":"of","start":3.0399999618530273,"end":3.5199999809265137},{"word":"the","start":3.5199999809265137,"end":3.5199999809265137},{"word":"site","start":3.5199999809265137,"end":3.5999999046325684},{"word":"there","start":4.079999923706055,"end":4.159999847412109},{"word":"is","start":4.159999847412109,"end":4.300000190734863},{"word":"a","start":4.300000190734863,"end":4.71999979019165},{"word":"flat","start":4.71999979019165,"end":4.820000171661377},{"word":"strip","start":4.820000171661377,"end":5.059999942779541},{"word":"of","start":5.059999942779541,"end":5.619999885559082},{"word":"ground","start":5.619999885559082,"end":5.619999885559082},{"word":"177","start":6.619999885559082,"end":7.260000228881836}